  "body": "## Summary\n\nThis PR fixes a grammar issue in `references/reports/CONTEXT.md` (line 5).\n\n## Problem\n\nThe parenthetical repeats its own head noun (\"the reference channel\") and then hangs an unattached participle on it, so the clause has no verb. The intended reading is that the channel was studied privately.\n\nThe problematic text:\n\n```markdown\nnext to the reference channel (the reference channel, studied\nprivately).\n```\n\n## Fix\n\nReplaced with:\n\n```markdown\nnext to the reference channel (studied\nprivately).\n```\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] Documentation fix (grammar)\n- [ ] Code change\n- [ ] Breaking change\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Documentation files only\n- [x] No code changes\n- [x] Fix verified against the original text\n",
